t"><div class="card__img-wrapper--outer undefined imageShape-default"><div class="card__img-wrapper--inner" aria-hidden="true"><img class="card__img" loading="eager" sizes="(min-width: 1920px) 960px, (min-width: 1024px) 800px, 640px" srcSet="/images/cards/student-cafe.x942e50ae.jpeg?h=640&amp;w=960&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=90&amp;f=webp 960w, /images/cards/student-cafe.x942e50ae.jpeg?h=533&amp;w=800&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=90&amp;f=webp 800w, /images/cards/student-cafe.x942e50ae.jpeg?h=427&amp;w=640&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=90&amp;f=webp 640w" alt="A group of students and staff inside a coffee shop." height="640" src="/images/cards/student-cafe.x942e50ae.jpeg?h=640&amp;w=960&amp;q=90&amp;f=webp" width="960"/></div></div><div class="card__content--container"><a class="card__link link" href="/student-life"><h2 class="h5">Student life</h2></a><p class="card__text--lead">Live student life to the fullest: Explore, engage, and excel at Ludlow University.</p></div></div><div class="cardstyled-sc-v7lpq3-0 cCETTg theme-light"><div class="card__img-wrapper--outer undefined imageShape-default"><div class="card__img-wrapper--inner" aria-hidden="true"><img class="card__img" loading="eager" sizes="(min-width: 1920px) 960px, (min-width: 1024px) 800px, 640px" srcSet="/images/cards/bubbles.xba477749.jpeg?h=640&amp;w=960&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=90&amp;f=webp 960w, /images/cards/bubbles.xba477749.jpeg?h=533&amp;w=800&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=90&amp;f=webp 800w, /images/cards/bubbles.xba477749.jpeg?h=427&amp;w=640&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=90&amp;f=webp 640w" alt="A slide depicting water droplets under different coloured lights." height="640" src="/images/cards/bubbles.xba477749.jpeg?h=640&amp;w=960&amp;q=90&amp;f=webp" width="960"/></div></div><div class="card__content--container"><span class="card__link link"><h2 class="h5">Our world famous research</h2></span><p class="card__text--lead">Explore boundaries and break barriers: Welcome to the forefront of innovation at Ludlow University.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div></div><div></div><div><div class="featuredContentstyled-sc-1u9bkcq-0 kFdFRB featured-content theme-light align-right"><div class="featured-content__grid"><div class="featured-content__body"><h3>Life at Ludlow</h3><div class="markupstyled__MarkupStyled-sc-rkc347-0 gGswEB markup user-content">As you step onto our vibrant campus, you'll find yourself immersed in a diverse community bustling with opportunities for personal growth, academic excellence, and lifelong friendships. </div><span class="buttonLinkstyled__ButtonStyled-sc-1nfcn4j-0 ejzNgk cta-btn  variant-secondary flavour-hollow theme-dark link">Find out more<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M20.03 8.22a.75.75 0 1 0-1.06 1.06l2.47 2.47H.75a.75.75 0 0 0 0 1.5h20.69l-2.47 2.47a.75.75 0 1 0 1.06 1.06l3.75-3.75a.747.747 0 0 0 0-1.06l-3.75-3.75Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></div><div class="featured-content__images"><img class="featured-content__image--large" loading="eager" sizes="(min-width: 1920px) 816px, (min-width: 1024px) 640px, 400px" srcSet="/images/featured-content/main/img-1.x249d68d5.png?h=680&amp;w=816&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=90&amp;f=webp 816w, /images/featured-content/main/img-1.x249d68d5.png?h=533&amp;w=640&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=90&amp;f=webp 640w, /images/featured-content/main/img-1.x249d68d5.png?h=333&amp;w=400&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=90&amp;f=webp 400w" alt="" height="680" src="/images/featured-content/main/img-1.x249d68d5.png?h=680&amp;w=816&amp;q=90&amp;f=webp" width="816"/><img class="featured-content__image--mini" loading="eager" sizes="(min-width: 1920px) 350px, (min-width: 1024px) 320px, 240px" srcSet="/images/featured-content/secondary/life-ludlow-mini.x25fa279b.png?h=352&amp;w=350&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=90&amp;f=webp 350w, /images/featured-content/secondary/life-ludlow-mini.x25fa279b.png?h=322&amp;w=320&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=90&amp;f=webp 320w, /images/featured-content/secondary/life-ludlow-mini.x25fa279b.png?h=241&amp;w=240&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=90&amp;f=webp 240w" alt="" height="352" src="/images/featured-content/secondary/life-ludlow-mini.x25fa279b.png?h=352&amp;w=350&amp;q=90&amp;f=webp" width="350"/></div></div></div></div><div></div></div></div></main><footer class="footerstyled-sc-zbe2dn-0 gfcnl"><div class="dynamicContentstyled-sc-ivggei-0 hliqYM"><h3 class="h2">Your move...</h3><div class="dynamic-content__row"><div class="dynamic-content__card--container"><div class="cardstyled-sc-v7lpq3-0 cCETTg noImage hasHoverEffect"><div class="card__content--container"><a class="card__link link" href="/apply-now"><h2 class="h5">Apply now</h2></a><p class="card__text--lead">Take the first step in shaping your future and join our vibrant and innovative university community.</p></div></div></div><div class="dynamic-content__card--container"><div class="cardstyled-sc-v7lpq3-0 cCETTg noImage hasHoverEffect"><div class="card__content--container"><a class="card__link link" href="/admissions"><h2 class="h5">Your next steps</h2></a><p class="card__text--lead">Explore our diverse range of activities, engage with faculty members and schedule campus tours to experience our vibrant community firsthand.</p></div></div></div><div class="dynamic-content__card--container"><div class="cardstyled-sc-v7lpq3-0 cCETTg noImage hasHoverEffect"><div class="card__content--container"><a class="card__link link" href="/chat-to-a-student"><h2 class="h5">Get support</h2></a><p class="card__text--lead">Need help with the application process? You can rely on our dedicated team for expert support and assistance every step of the way.</p></div></div></div><div class="dynamic-content__card--container"><div class="cardstyled-sc-v7lpq3-0 cCETTg noImage hasHoverEffect"><div class="card__content--container"><a class="card__link link" href="/contact-us"><h2 class="h5">Contact us </h2></a><p class="card__text--lead">Reach out to us with any enquiries or concerns you may have regarding 